%% Yole - OAuth2 Authentication Flow
%% Covers Dropbox, Google Drive, and OneDrive OAuth2 variants

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as Platform App
    participant SVC as Protocol Service
    participant OAuth as OAuth2Flow<br/>(Dropbox/Google/OneDrive)
    participant ATM as AuthTokenManager
    participant SS as SecureStorage<br/>(Platform-specific)
    participant Browser as System Browser
    participant Provider as OAuth2 Provider<br/>(Dropbox/Google/Microsoft)

    Note over User,Provider: Initial Authentication (First-Time Setup)

    User->>App: Add cloud storage connection
    App->>App: Create StorageConfig with<br/>clientId, clientSecret

    App->>OAuth: getAuthorizationUrl()
    OAuth->>OAuth: Build URL with:<br/>- client_id<br/>- redirect_uri<br/>- response_type=code<br/>- scope (provider-specific)<br/>- state (CSRF protection)
    OAuth-->>App: Authorization URL

    App->>Browser: Open authorization URL
    Browser->>Provider: Navigate to consent page
    Provider->>User: Display permission request
    User->>Provider: Grant access
    Provider->>Browser: Redirect to callback URL<br/>with authorization code
    Browser-->>App: Callback with auth code + state

    App->>OAuth: exchangeCodeForTokens(authCode)
    OAuth->>Provider: POST /oauth2/token<br/>{grant_type: authorization_code,<br/> code, client_id, client_secret,<br/> redirect_uri}
    Provider-->>OAuth: TokenResponse<br/>{access_token, refresh_token,<br/> expires_in, token_type}
    OAuth-->>App: TokenResponse

    Note over User,Provider: Secure Token Storage

    App->>ATM: storeTokenInfo(accessToken,<br/>refreshToken, expiresIn)
    ATM->>ATM: Acquire mutex lock
    ATM->>SS: storeToken("dropbox_access", token)
    SS->>SS: Platform-specific encryption<br/>Android: EncryptedSharedPreferences<br/>iOS: Keychain<br/>Desktop: OS keystore
    SS-->>ATM: Result.success
    ATM->>SS: storeToken("dropbox_refresh", token)
    SS-->>ATM: Result.success
    ATM->>SS: store("dropbox_expires",<br/>Clock.now() + expiresIn)
    SS-->>ATM: Result.success
    ATM-->>App: Result.success

    Note over User,Provider: Subsequent Connection (Token Reuse)

    App->>SVC: connect()
    SVC->>ATM: hasValidToken()
    ATM->>ATM: Acquire mutex lock
    ATM->>SS: retrieveToken("dropbox_access")
    SS-->>ATM: Access token
    ATM->>SS: retrieve("dropbox_expires")
    SS-->>ATM: Expiration timestamp
    ATM->>ATM: Compare now vs expiresAt

    alt Token valid (not expired)
        ATM-->>SVC: true
        SVC->>SVC: Use stored access token
        SVC-->>App: Connected
    else Token expired
        ATM-->>SVC: false
        Note over SVC,Provider: Token Refresh Cycle
    end

    Note over User,Provider: Token Refresh Cycle

    SVC->>ATM: getRefreshToken()
    ATM->>SS: retrieveToken("dropbox_refresh")
    SS-->>ATM: Refresh token
    ATM-->>SVC: Refresh token

    SVC->>OAuth: refreshToken(refreshToken)
    OAuth->>Provider: POST /oauth2/token<br/>{grant_type: refresh_token,<br/> refresh_token, client_id,<br/> client_secret}
    Provider-->>OAuth: New TokenResponse<br/>{access_token, refresh_token?,<br/> expires_in}
    OAuth-->>SVC: New tokens

    SVC->>ATM: storeTokenInfo(newAccessToken,<br/>newRefreshToken, expiresIn)
    ATM->>SS: Update all tokens
    SS-->>ATM: Stored securely
    ATM-->>SVC: Result.success

    SVC->>SVC: Resume operations with new token

    Note over User,Provider: Token Invalidation / Logout

    User->>App: Disconnect storage
    App->>SVC: disconnect()
    SVC->>ATM: clearTokens()
    ATM->>SS: deleteToken("dropbox_access")
    ATM->>SS: deleteToken("dropbox_refresh")
    ATM->>SS: delete("dropbox_expires")
    SS-->>ATM: Tokens cleared
    ATM-->>SVC: Result.success
    SVC-->>App: Disconnected

    Note over User,Provider: Provider-Specific Differences
    Note right of Provider: Dropbox: /oauth2/token (api.dropboxapi.com)<br/>Google: /o/oauth2/token (oauth2.googleapis.com)<br/>Microsoft: /oauth2/v2.0/token (login.microsoftonline.com)
